{
  "id": "2KI.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Ayi 6",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha akujajaŵalisya liŵago pacanya pa mesi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line likuga lya ŵakulocesya liŵalilolelaga Elisha, lyamdandawulile jwalakwe kuti, “Malo agano gatukutama ni ŵalakwe ganandipe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukunde kuti tujawule mungulugulu Lusulo lwa Yolodani, kuti tukakate yitela yakutaŵila malo gakuti tutameje.” Elisha ŵajanjile kuti, “Cambone, jawulani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jumo jwa ŵakulocesya ŵamwusisye Elisha kuti, “Uli ŵalakwe alongane ni uweji?” Elisha ŵajiticisye, ni ŵatite, “Cambone, kwende.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Elisha ŵalongene nawo. Ali ayice ku Yolodani, ŵatandite kukata yitela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jumo jwa ŵakulocesya piŵaliji mkata citela, liŵago lyakwe lyakulice, ni lyagwilile m'mesi, ni ŵagumisile kuti, “Kongwene ambuje ŵangu! Liŵago lyelelitu ndesile lyakwasima!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana lyagwilile papi?” Ali amlosisye malo gigagwilile liŵagolyo, Elisha ŵatemangwile katela ni ŵakaponyisye pamesipo, nipo liŵago lyajajaŵele pacanya pa mesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵamsalile jwalakwejo kuti, “Mjawule, mkalokote.” Jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jula ŵajineme ni ŵatambasukwile mkono ŵakwe ni kulokota liŵagolyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha akwatatalisya meso asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Siliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Siliya ŵaliji pa ngondo ni cilambo ca Isalaeli. Ŵaŵecetene ni nduna syakwe, ni ŵapangene malo gakuja kutaŵa masakasa gawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Elisha ŵatumisye maloŵe gakumkalamusya mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, ŵatite, “Mwenye akalamuce, akajawula kumalo gamtigamtigo, ligongo asilikali wa ngondo ŵa ku Siliya ajuŵile kweleko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli ŵakalamusyaga asilikali ŵakwe ŵiŵatamaga jele mbalijo, kuti aŵe mesope. Elisha ŵamkalamwisye mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli masiku gejinji, nipo jwalakwe ŵakulupwice ku ngondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Siliya ŵaliji mkusimonga ni muyatendecelaga yele yinduyi. Nipo ŵasiŵilasile nduna syakwe ni ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana ŵani sikati ja jemanja ŵakwasalila mwenye ŵa ku Isalaeli yindu yitukupangana pacisyepela?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jumo jwa nduna syakwe ŵajanjile kuti, “Ambuje ŵangu, pangali mundu jwali kumbali ja mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli. Nambo Elisha jwakulocesya jwa ku Isalaeli ni jwakusamsalila mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli maloŵe gosope, atamose maloŵe gakuŵeceta ŵalakwe ku cipinda kwawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Siliyajo ŵatite, “Mjawule mkalole kwakutama, kuti natume asilikali akamkamule.” Ŵanduwo piŵawusile ŵamsalile kuti, “Ali ku Dotani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mwenyejo ŵatumisye mahaci ni mageleta, pamo ni likuga lya asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵamacili. Asilikaliwo ŵajile kwika ku Dotani cilo, ni ŵawusyungulile msindawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwamasengo jwa Elisha, piŵajimwice ni kukopoka m'nyumba kundaŵindaŵipe, ŵagambile kuliwona likuga lya asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵakwela pa mahaci ni mageleta ŵa ku Siliya, ali awusyungulile msinda wosopewo. Ŵawujile m'nyumba kwa Elisha, ni ŵatite, “Kongwene ambuje! Ana tutende uli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵamsalile kuti, “Mkasimtenda woga, pakuŵa asilikali ŵali kumbali jetu ali ŵajinji kwapunda mwaŵelele jemanjajo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Elisha ŵapopesile kuti, “Conde AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ngwaŵenda kuti amwugule meso jwamasengo jwanguju kuti alole.” Myoyo AMBUJE ŵagawugwile meso ga jwamasengojo, nipo ŵaweni kuti litumbi lyosope lili lyegumbale ni mahaci ni mageleta ga moto gali gamsyungulile Elisha jula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵajitandite kuputa ngondo asilikali ŵa ku Siliya, Elisha ŵapopesile kwa AMBUJE, ŵatite kuti, “Conde ngwaŵenda kuti ŵatatalesye meso ŵandu ŵeleŵa.” Myoyo AMBUJE ŵatatalesye meso asilikali ŵa ku Siliya ŵala, mpela muŵaŵendele Elisha mula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵajawile kwa asilikaliwo ni ŵasalile kuti, “Jemanja msokonecele, mjesile litala lyacabe, soni msinda wumkuwusosa nganiwuŵa awuno. Kwende munguye une, tinampecesye mpaka kwa mundu jumkumsosajo.” Myoyo ŵalongolele mpaka ŵajile kwika ku msinda ŵa Samaliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali amasile kwinjila asilikali mu msinda wa Samaliyawo, Elisha ŵapopesile kwa AMBUJE, ŵatite kuti, “Ŵalakwe AMBUJE, sambano ŵawugule meso ŵanduŵa kuti alole soni.” Myoyo AMBUJE ŵajanjile lipopelo lyakwe, ni ŵagawugwile meso gawo, nipo ŵaweni kuti ali mkati mwa msinda wa Samaliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli piŵaweni asilikali ŵa ku Siliya mu msindamo, ŵamwusisye Elisha kuti, “Ana nawulaje jemanjaji ambuje ŵangu? Ana nawulaje?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ŵajanjile kuti, “Iyayi, mkawulaga. Atamose yikaŵe kuti m'mwejo mwakamwile asilikali ŵeleŵa pakumenyana nawo ngondo, ngimkinimwawulaga. Nambo mwape yakulya ni yakumwa kuti apate macili, kaneko mwakunde kuti ajawuleje kwa ambuje ŵawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli jula ŵakolocesye asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Siliya ŵala cindimba cacikulungwa. Ali amasile kulya ni kumwa, mwenyewo ŵakundile asilikaliwo kuti ajawuleje kwa ambuje ŵawo, mwenye jwa ku Siliya. Kutandila pelepo asilikali ŵa ku Siliya ŵalesile kwatanda ŵandu ŵa cilambo ca Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Siliya akuwusyungulila msinda wa Samaliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jili jipite ndaŵi jajilewu, Beni Hadadi mwenye jwa ku Siliya, ŵalilongolele likuga lya asilikali ŵakwe kuja kuputa ngondo ku Isalaeli, ni ŵataŵile masakasa gawo kusyungulila msinda wa ku Samaliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo lyakuti asilikali ŵa ku Siliya ŵawusyungulile msindawo, kwaliji kwana sala jajikulungwa mu msindawo, mwakuti mtwe wa bulu ŵawusumaga ni mbiya sya silifa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " 80. Ni magalamu 200 ga ndotosi sya ngunda ŵasumisyaga pa mtengo wa masekeli ga silifa msano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli piŵaliji mkwendajenda pacanya pa mapupa ga msinda, jwamkongwe jwine ŵamdandawulile jwalakwe, ŵatite kuti, “Conde ambuje mwenye ŵangu, angamucisye une.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵajanjile, ŵatite kuti, “Naga AMBUJE ngakumkamucisya m'mwejo, ana une mpaka nampe cikamucisyo camtuli? Ana mkuganicisya kuti uneji ngwete yakulya kapena finyo wampaka kumgaŵila m'mwejo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ŵawusisye soni kuti, Nambo msale cindu cisyesyene cisawisye?” Jwalakwejo ŵajanjile kuti, “Lisiku line jwamkongwe aju ŵasalile une kuti, mwulaje mwanace jwenu kuti tumlye lelo, jwaune tumlye malaŵi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo twamtelece mwanace jwangujo, nipo twamlile. Kundaŵi kwakwe namsalile jwalakweju kuti, mumwulaje mwanace jwenu jula kuti tumlye. Nambo jwalakweju amsisile mwanace jwakwejo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.57"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 28:57",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Mali 4:10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye piŵapikene maloŵe ga jwamkongwejo, ŵapapwile yakuwala yakwe ligongo lya canasa, ŵandu ŵiŵaŵandicile lipupa liŵajendaga mwenye lila, ŵam'weni jwalakwejo kuti ŵawete ciguduli mkati mwa yakuwala yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ŵala ŵatite, “Mlungu ambulaje une, naga mtwe wa Elisha ngawukatidwa lelo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵamtumile mundu kuti akamjigale Elishajo. Elisha ŵaliji mkunguluka ni acakulungwakulungwa ŵa Aisalaeli ku nyumba jakwe. Nambo jwa mtengajo mkanayice, Elisha ŵasalile acakulungwakulungwa ŵiŵaliji nawo ŵala kuti, “Mundu jwakuwulaga ŵandu jula amtumile mundu kuti akate mtwe wangu. Pitayice mundu jwamtumilejo, jemanja timwugale litanga, mkamkunda jwalakwejo kuti ajinjile amuno. Mwenye taŵe munyuma mwa jwalakwejo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha ali ciŵela kuŵecetana ni acakulungwakulungwa ŵala, mwenye ŵayice, ni ŵatite kuti, “AMBUJE ni ŵapelece yele yisawusyoyi. Ana yikomboleka uli kuti une njembeceye cikamucisyo cakutyocela kwa AMBUJE?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
